                                                "sense_id": "2c0dc13d-ffd2-3d4c-bcc2-22f0314e0e1a",
                                                "text": "Still going strong in his ninth decade, Wein celebrates his 88th birthday behind the piano accompanied by the latest iteration of his band, the Newport All-Stars, featuring tenor saxophonist […]"
                                            },
                                            {
